      "text": "I am he that comforteth you, 2 Ne. 8:12. the Lord hath comforted his people, Mosiah 12:23 (15:30; Alma 17:10; 3 Ne. 16:19; 20:34; Isa. 52:9). those baptized should be willing to comfort those in need of comfort, Mosiah 18:9. wilt thou comfort my soul in Christ, Alma 31:31. blessed are they that mourn, for they shall be comforted, 3 Ne. 12:4 (Matt. 5:4). soul of Coriantumr2 refused to be comforted, Ether 15:3.",
